        <mxCell id="rules" value="Rules (enforced by branch protection, no exceptions for humans or agents):&#10;✗ direct push to main / master — forbidden (no exceptions, see AGENTS.md)&#10;✗ merge commit or rebase merge — only squash-merge allowed&#10;✗ manual git tag creation — only CI creates tags&#10;✗ long-lived release branches — tags on main mark releases" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=10" vertex="1" parent="1">
